# CBT Platform — Developer & AI Rules

Follow the authoritative project rules defined in `.antigravity/rules.md`:
1. Single Express server on port 8080 serving client/dist static assets.
2. Design System: "Vintage Technical Instrument & Academic Journal" theme.
   - Fonts: Newsreader / Playfair Display (Serif), IBM Plex Mono (Monospace), Inter (Sans).
   - Colors: Parchment #FBF9F5, Inset wells #F4EFEA, Ink #1C1D21, Ochre Gold #C88A2D, Royal Ink #1A2B4C, Emerald #236B47, Crimson #A83232.
   - Tactile buttons with shadow-[2px_2px_0px_0px_#1C1D21] and mechanical active depress.
3. Registration is disabled; Admin name is Rajat Kolhapure (admin@cbt.com).
4. Always verify TypeScript builds (`npm run build` in client and server) before staging commits.
